@HostAddress = http://localhost:5218
@secret = dev-notification-secret

### Health
GET {{HostAddress}}/health

### Vendor webhook: text message / SMS
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/webhooks/text-messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Notification-Secret: {{secret}}

{
  "reference": "vendor-sms-001",
  "phoneNumber": "+2348012345678",
  "message": "Your policy renewal is due.",
  "senderId": "Notify"
}

### Vendor webhook: email
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/webhooks/emails
Content-Type: application/json
X-Notification-Secret: {{secret}}

{
  "reference": "vendor-email-001",
  "to": "client@example.com",
  "subject": "Policy renewal",
  "body": "Your policy renewal is due.",
  "isHtml": false
}

### Delivery receipt
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/webhooks/delivery-receipts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Notification-Secret: {{secret}}

{
  "vendorReference": "vendor-sms-001",
  "channel": "Sms",
  "delivered": true,
  "detail": "Delivered to handset"
}

### Text message counts
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/text-messages/summary
X-Notification-Secret: {{secret}}

### Email counts
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/emails/summary
X-Notification-Secret: {{secret}}

### Combined counts
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/message-reports/summary
X-Notification-Secret: {{secret}}
